# Customer Retention & Churn Analytics
![Customer Retention Dashboard](./dashboard.png)

## Project Overview
An end-to-end data analytics project that analyzes customer purchasing behaviour and segments customers using RFM (Recency, Frequency, Monetary) analysis.

## Objectives
- Understand customer purchasing behaviour.
- Identify high-value and loyal customers.
- Identify inactive and potential churn-risk customers.
- Provide actionable business recommendations.

## Tools & Technologies
- Python
- Pandas and NumPy
- MySQL
- Power BI
- Excel

## Project Workflow
1. Cleaned and prepared the Online Retail II dataset.
2. Performed RFM analysis using Python.
3. Assigned RFM scores and customer segments.
4. Imported customer-level data into MySQL.
5. Performed SQL-based customer analysis.
6. Created an interactive Power BI dashboard.
7. Developed business insights and recommendations.

## Customer Segments
- Champions
- Loyal Customers
- Potential Loyalists
- Recent Customers
- At Risk
- Cannot Lose Them
- Hibernating
- Others

## Important Note
This project uses RFM segmentation and recency-based rules to identify potential churn risk. It does not use a machine learning model to predict churn.

